<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Nevaeh — Shared Workspace</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/nevaeh/os.css?v=7"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/nevaeh/stage.css?v=1"><%= csrf_meta_tags %><link rel="stylesheet" href="/nevaeh/workforce.css?v=2"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/lightek/guided-tour.css?v=1"><script src="/lightek/guided-tour.js?v=1" defer></script></head>
<body data-tour-app="nevaeh" data-tour-account="<%= current_user.id %>"<%= ' data-tour-quiet' if alert.present? %>><a class="skip-link" href="#q">Skip to conversation</a><div class="app"><aside class="navigation" aria-label="Nevaeh navigation">
<a class="brand" href="/dashboard" data-tour-step="nevaeh" data-tour-title="Back to Dashboard" data-tour-body="Open Dashboard any time to get to the rest of your Lightek tools."><span class="brand-mark">L</span>LIGHTEK <span class="back">/</span></a>
<div class="workspace-label">YOUR WORKSPACE</div>
<a class="nav-item active" href="/dashboard/nevaeh" aria-current="page">◈ <span>Shared workspace</span></a>
<% if NevaehOs::ExecutiveBrief.available_to?(current_user) %>
  <%= link_to dashboard_nevaeh_executive_path, class: "nav-item" do %>▦ <span>CEO Desk</span><% end %>
<% end %>
<button class="nav-item" data-stage-kind="guide">▤ <span>Guide &amp; capabilities</span></button>
<button class="nav-item" id="stage-studio">▣ <span>Studio library</span></button>
<button class="nav-item" data-command="/produce personalities">◇ <span>Character personalities</span></button>
<button class="nav-item" id="learning-link" hidden data-stage-kind="learning">◇ <span>Learning &amp; study</span></button>
<button class="nav-item" aria-label="Workforce &amp; goals" data-stage-kind="workforce">▦ <span>Workforce &amp; goals</span></button><div class="section-heading"><h2>Coordinators</h2><button id="gen" class="icon-button" aria-label="Create an agent">+</button></div><div id="ags"></div>
<% if current_user.role == 'super_admin' %><%= link_to 'Agency onboarding', dashboard_nevaeh_onboarding_path, class: 'nav-item' %><% end %>
<details class="sidebar-detail"><summary>Workers &amp; schedules</summary><div class="quick"><button data-stage-kind="workforce">Roles, tasks &amp; goals</button><a href="/dashboard/nevaeh/guide?topic=agents">How to delegate</a></div><div id="agent-jobs"></div></details>
<details class="sidebar-detail" id="watcher-tools" hidden><summary>Watchers</summary><button data-command="/watch list">All watchers</button><div id="watcher-list"></div></details>
<details class="sidebar-detail" id="host-tools" hidden><summary>Server &amp; applications</summary><div class="quick"><button data-command="/ubuntu status">Server status</button><button data-command="/models">Data console</button></div><label class="upload-label">Add application input<input id="app-upload" type="file"></label></details>
<div class="nav-footer"><span id="connection" role="status">Connecting…</span><small id="model-count">Loading model status</small><a href="/dashboard">← Back to Dashboard</a></div>
</aside>
<main id="core" class="core"><header class="stage-header"><div><span class="eyebrow">ONE PLACE FOR THE WORK</span><h2 id="stage-title">Your work, together</h2></div><button type="button" class="lightek-tour-trigger" data-tour-open hidden>Take a tour</button><button class="btn" id="stage-refresh">Refresh</button></header><div class="stage-toolbar" data-tour-step="nevaeh" data-tour-title="Open your work" data-tour-body="Select a production to open its scenes and keep the work beside your conversation."><label class="sr-only" for="stage-production">Open production</label><select id="stage-production"><option value="">Open a production…</option></select><div id="scene-controls" hidden><label class="sr-only" for="stage-scene">Current scene</label><select id="stage-scene"></select><button class="btn primary" id="stage-rehearse">Rehearse scene</button></div></div><nav id="work-tabs" aria-label="Open work"></nav><div class="stage-view-tabs" id="stage-views" hidden><button data-stage-view="stage" aria-pressed="true">Blocking &amp; rehearsal</button><button data-stage-view="studio" aria-pressed="false">3D Studio</button><button data-stage-view="script" aria-pressed="false">Script</button><button data-stage-view="tasks" aria-pressed="false">Production tasks</button></div><p id="stage-notice" role="status"></p><section class="stage-content"><div id="stage-home"><div class="stage-illustration" aria-hidden="true"><div class="stage-orbit"></div><span class="scene-tile tile-script">SCRIPT</span><span class="scene-tile tile-scene">SCENE</span><span class="scene-tile tile-work">WORKERS</span><nevaeh-presence mode="inline"></nevaeh-presence></div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR SHARED STAGE</span><h2>Bring the pieces together.</h2><p>Open a production, bring in a task, or keep another Dashboard workspace here. Talk to Nevaeh while you work.</p><div class="stage-home-actions"><button class="btn" data-stage-kind="workforce">Open workforce &amp; goals</button><button class="btn" data-stage-kind="guide">Explore capabilities</button><button class="btn primary" data-draft="make me a funny tiktok campaign ad promoting ">Create a campaign</button></div></div><section id="stage-map" hidden><div class="map-header"><span id="map-count"></span><span>Drag a character to propose a route</span></div><svg id="blocking-map" viewBox="-16 -16 32 32" role="img" aria-label="Scene floor plan with characters, cameras, personal space and proposed paths"></svg><div id="rehearsal-result" aria-live="polite"></div></section><section id="stage-script" hidden><div class="script-toolbar"><span id="stage-script-status">Saved scene script</span><button id="stage-save-script" class="btn primary">Save script</button><button id="stage-discard-script" class="btn">Discard local draft</button></div><label class="sr-only" for="stage-script-text">Scene script</label><textarea id="stage-script-text" maxlength="50000" spellcheck="true"></textarea></section><section id="stage-tasks" hidden></section><section id="stage-embed" hidden></section><section id="stage-result" hidden></section></section><details class="inspector" aria-label="Task details"><summary>Activity, sources &amp; memory</summary><div class="section-heading"><h2>Your activity</h2><button class="text-button" data-command="/status">View all</button></div><div id="operations" class="operations" aria-live="polite"></div><details open><summary>Sources &amp; execution evidence</summary><div id="inf"><p class="empty">References and action evidence appear with each response.</p></div></details><details><summary>Memory &amp; preferences <span id="rc">0</span></summary><p class="empty">Choose what Nevaeh can remember. Disabling a category deletes its memories.</p><div id="mc"></div><div id="rem"></div></details><details><summary>Workspace activity</summary><div id="lint"></div></details><div class="principles"><span class="eyebrow">GROUNDED IN PRINCIPLE</span><p>Truth · Trust · Justice<br>Mercy · Excellence</p><small>Sources, permissions, and receipts make the work inspectable.</small></div></details>
</main><aside class="conversation-panel" aria-label="Conversation with Nevaeh"><header class="assistant-header"><nevaeh-presence mode="inline"></nevaeh-presence><div><h1 id="rn">Nevaeh</h1><p id="rl">Operating intelligence</p></div></header><div class="conversation"><section id="welcome" class="chat-welcome"><span class="eyebrow">LET'S WORK TOGETHER</span><h2>Tell me what you have in mind.</h2><p>Your current scene and tasks stay on the stage beside us.</p><button data-draft="make a 22 minute comedy episode called ">Start an episode</button></section><div id="trail" class="conversation-trail" aria-label="Conversation history"></div>
<article id="ans" class="answer"><div class="request"><span>YOU</span><p id="aq"></p></div><div class="response"><b id="aa">Nevaeh</b><div id="at" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><div id="receipt"></div><div id="task-dialogue"></div><div id="atags" class="tags"></div><div id="mem" class="mem"><span id="mt"></span><button class="btn" id="my">Remember</button><button class="btn" id="mn">Not this</button></div></div></article>
</div>
<div class="composer"><nevaeh-voice-controls></nevaeh-voice-controls><div class="composer-toolbar"><div class="modes" id="modes" aria-label="Conversation mode"><button class="on" aria-pressed="true">Converse</button><button aria-pressed="false">Operate</button><button aria-pressed="false">Decide</button><button aria-pressed="false">Reflect</button></div><button id="spk" class="text-button" aria-pressed="false">Read replies aloud</button></div><form id="f"><label class="sr-only" for="q">Your request to Nevaeh</label><textarea id="q" data-tour-step="nevaeh" data-tour-title="Talk to Nevaeh" data-tour-body="Describe what you want to do. Use the modes above to ask questions, preview work, or run supported actions." data-tour-try rows="2" maxlength="4000" placeholder="Tell me what you want to make or do…"></textarea><div class="composer-actions"><span id="mode-help">Ask questions and run supported requests.</span><button class="btn" id="mic" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Voice</button><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Send request</button></div></form><p class="composer-note">Actions follow your account permissions. Preview work with Decide or Reflect.</p></div>
</aside></div><dialog id="mo"><form id="gf"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR TEAM</span><h2>Create an agent</h2><label>Name<input name="n" required maxlength="40" placeholder="e.g. Noor"></label><label>Role<input name="role" required maxlength="80" placeholder="e.g. Production coordinator"></label><p class="empty">Agents work within your account permissions. Assign real work through delegation.</p><div class="dialog-actions"><button class="btn" type="button" id="gx">Cancel</button><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Create agent</button></div></form></dialog>
<div class="toast" id="toast" role="status"></div><script src="/nevaeh/voice.js?v=3" defer></script><script src="/nevaeh/page-tasks.js?v=2" defer></script><script src="/lightek/nevaeh-reply-stream.js?v=1" defer></script><script src="/nevaeh/presence.js?v=9" defer></script><script src="/nevaeh/task-dialogue.js?v=1" defer></script><script src="/nevaeh/os.js?v=13" defer></script><script src="/nevaeh/reports.js?v=2" defer></script><script src="/nevaeh/workforce.js?v=3" defer></script><script src="/nevaeh/stage.js?v=3" defer></script></body></html>